'''Croco''' (ワニック, ''Wanikku'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

