==Enemy==
This enemy has low health and damage, but his attack rate and movement speed are fast. You will usually have many thrown at you at once, but they are still quite easy to defeat. Croco is mostly used as a peon for stronger enemies.

==Strategy==
Use a quick attacker like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat/Giraffe Cat]] or [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat/Artist Cat]] to eliminate them quickly. [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area]] or [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat/UFO Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] can also work to destroy a group of Crocos.

