==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Croco
|Kroxo
|The [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of Croco. He is slower, has 4 knockbacks and far higher stats.
|Zroco
|The [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of Croco. It retains his singular knockback and deals much more damage, with a 30% chance to weaken cat units by 50% for 5 seconds. It also pushes with a short-ranged burrow and revives once after a long delay.
|Croconator
|The [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of Croco. Although he does more damage, he attacks slower, and has extremely low health for a metal.
|Crocodylidae Kurocroc
|The [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of Croco. Rather than being a peon, Kurocroc is a [[Mr. Puffington]]-like enemy with extremely high health and damage, an Omni Strike that extends their already high range a fair bit and a 100% chance to weaken Cat Units by 50% for 3 seconds. Their slower attack rate is balanced by a relatively long backswing. They boast immunity to slow and freeze on top of their high movement speed, though their 20 knockbacks make them easy to hold back until other threats enter play.
}}

