==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Wanikku (ワニック), is a portmanteau of ワニ ''wani'' (crocodile) and パニック ''panikku'' (panic). As his [[Kumanchu Royale]] description hinted, this is a reference to ''Wani Wani Panic'' (ワニワニパニック ''Wani Wani Panikku''), the Japanese name of the arcade game ''[[wikipedia:Gator Panic|Gator Panic]]''.
*"He was saved by Dundee" is a reference to the movie ''[[wikipedia:Crocodile Dundee|Crocodile Dundee]]''.

